e sort of  trouble with the American government and  most likely the world it makes sense  that Val would want her for a part of  this team now here's where it gets  interesting it says that Songbird is  part of the team she wasn't announced at  d23 because there is no cast yet  although Ella Purnell is the front  runner for being Melissa Gold now  Songbird is a really cool character in  Marvel Comics she has really really cool  Powers with her her voice she can create  Sonic blasts you can even create force  fields with her voice and she can even  create some objects with her voice as  well she can create platforms she can  create battering rams basically her  voice is a crazy cool weapon she also  has the same abilities that a typical  superhero would have like superhuman  strength superhuman speed she can also  use her voice to create wings of pure  energy so she's pretty cool and I hope  this ends up being true and Della  Purnell could definitely lock down this  look now here's where it gets kind of  crazy it's revealed that Val is the  director of damage control which in all  honesty if this is true doesn't surprise  me that much damage control is  definitely kind of iffy when it comes to  a lot of things like them attacking kids  so it would make sense that Val would be  behind it because let's face it she's  kind of sketchy it says that there are  going to be teases for World War Hulk in  this film and since Captain America 4 is  going to be the movie coming out right  before the Thunderbolts film and it's  been rumored to have other hulks in it  that would make sense that they would  continue to tease a World War Hulk in  this film now of course many people are  going to be wondering after Hawkeye  after Yelena Bulova now knows that  Valentina lied to her about who killed  her sister she's obviously going to have  some beef with Valentina and one of the  plot points that this mentions is that  Yelena has her own agenda against Val  for lying to her about Natasha's death  and she tries to convince the others a  part of the team to remove Valentina  from the team and from here we kind of  get a mini Civil War storyline it seems  Alexi Bucky and Taskmaster are with  Elena for using Nat's death and ghost us  agent and Songbird are with Val because  Val gave them a new reason to be  important to be needed so as you can  imagine there is a fight between the two  different groups the separation so  there's gonna be a fight and I gotta say  I'm here for it because I'd love to see  a fight between us agent and the Red  Guardian both of them have taken super  soldier serum or at least some type of  it a variant of it if you will but  essentially both are super soldiers who  have fought with shields before so I  think this will be a pretty cool fight  now from here here it gets kind of  questionable and I'll explain what I  mean by that in just a second it says  because of yelena's treason Val murders  Molina and of course Molina is like her  mom or the closest thing that she's ever  had to a mom and apparently this leads  to yulina killing Val and the team is  disbanded after this now this part is  entirely believable it is definitely  something that Valentina would do and  Yelena would definitely kill Val after  all she almost killed Hawkeye and  Hawkeye is a good guy I'm sure she would  gladly kill Valentina after Valentina  killed her mom or like I said the  closest thing to it now I don't really  see Molina having a huge part in the MCU  moving forward after a Thunderbolts  movie so her dying in the film isn't  really that big of a shock I can buy  that however Julia louis-dreyfus's  character Valentina she was seemingly  set up to have a pretty big part in the  MCU now that could all be leading to  this movie The Thunderbolts in which  that could be the end for her which I  totally buy but at the same time I feel  like Marvel Studios might want to keep  her around for a little bit longer now  this does finish by saying that the team  is disbanded until the post-credits  scene where U.S agent ghost and Songbird  receive a message from a user named  citizen V citizen V is a Superhero in  Marvel Comics and many people have  actually been citizen V taken on the  mantle and at one point in time even  Zemo had taken on the mantle but he did  it as a villain pretending to be good he  even put a group of villains together  pretending to be superheroes until they  were eventually discovered and defeated  by The Avengers but it would make sense  that if Zemo is sort of on the sidelines  kind of helping out just a little bit  that at the end of this film if Val is  gone he would pop up and try to create a  team of his own because we definitely  know that he's not good he is a villain  now I like this I think this is all good  and well however I'm not sure Marvel  Studios has planned this far out yet  we're about two years away so I really  doubt that the post-credits scene for  this film has been written yet however I  do think that there is some validity to  other things that have been said on here  and actually some of this is just common  knowledge of what would actually happen  in this film it's very obvious that  Elena is not just going to be okay with  Valentina lying to her so she's clearly  going to go up against Valentina and of  course Red Guardian is going to take her  aside I would assume that Bucky would  take her side as well because of Natasha  and his relationship with her and of  course Steve Rogers but you as agent  John Walker has been recruited by  Valentina so it would make sense that he  would take her side and some other  members take her side as well and  considering they're kind of a group of  villains them fighting each other is  definitely going to happen and honestly  I see Valentina being the head of damage  control now the movie may not be fully  scripted out yet but Marvel Studios  definitely has a plan leading up to the  film and they have an idea of what they  want to happen in the film as well so  all of this is completely believable  except for the ending for the  post-credits scene and I kind of expect  it to happen and what some insiders do  sometimes is they put in the truth mixed  with some of their own theories which  I'm kind of assuming is happening here  but hey let me know what you think about  all this in the comments down below I'd  actually like to see a lot of this play  out on screen but let me know what you  think don't forget to like the video and  subscribe so you don't miss out on any  of the latest MCU news for live updates  you can follow me on Instagram and  Twitter and as always thank you all so  much for watching wolf
 

